<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Aug 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Aug 14.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Iraqi press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Iraq starts oil exports via the Turkish port of Ceyhan.</p>
<p>- The United Nations approves contracts to export Iraqi oil under the oil-for-food deal.</p>
<p>IRAQ</p>
<p>- Irrigation minister receives the Syrian team to the Iraqi-Syrian border committee.</p>
<p>- Egyptian firms to hold food and medicine exhibition in Baghdad.</p>
</text>
